@startuml
!include style.puml
skinparam ArrowFontStyle plain
skinparam DefaultFontSize 15
mainframe sd CheckExportDestination
participant ":ExportCommand" as Command LOGIC_COLOR
participant "<<class>>\nFileUtil" as FileUtil STORAGE_COLOR
Command -> FileUtil : resolvePath(filePath)
FileUtil --> Command : path
note over Command : Convert to an absolute, normalized target path.
loop application, session lock, roster, preferences and backups
Command -> Command : checkDestination(target, protectedFile)
activate Command
note over Command
Reject equivalent normalized paths
and existing aliases (Files.isSameFile).
end note
deactivate Command
end
note over Command
Also reject reserved recovery-file names
beside the protected roster/preferences file,
and destinations that are existing directories.
Require the parent to exist and be a directory.
Any IOException becomes a CommandException;
no CSV write starts on failure.
end note
@enduml
